    "reviews_section_7Waym": {
      "type": "reviews-section",
      "blocks": {
        "review_a1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Emily R.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>I finally found the perfect travel sleep solution! Regular neck pillows never worked for me, but this one keeps my head supported, my hands comfortable, and my body warm. I slept better than ever on my flight! Highly recommend!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/61qqdGVu1VL.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_a2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Laura K.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>You might look a little funny but worked like a charm sleep 5 straight hours on a red eye 6 hour flight.<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/71UJJFUuNrL.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_a3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "David K.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>I saw this product on social media and figured I would give it a try with a lot of travel coming up. All I can say is this definitely helps with sleeping on the flight. It does look like a spectacle putting this together but you’ll be glad you did. It keeps you head in place, shuts the eyes and keeps the arms tucked in. If you’re claustrophobic this is NOT for you! I woke up one time and snatched it off before orienting myself. After that I was comfortable using it. I was able to get way more sleep on my flights even in the economy seats. Great product. Also, kudos to whoever did the case design with a locking carabiner. You will definitely not lose this setup easily.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "review_a4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Jessica T.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>I used this on a 14 hour flight. It was very comfortable and I was actually able to get some sleep! The head piece keeps your neck in alignment so you don't wake up with any pain. The eye mask blocks out all the light. There is a cushion on the eye mask so it doesn't press into your eyes. The sling might be my favorite part! It gives you great support for your arms and a little hug. It was really easy to set up on the seat and took less than a minute. Great for long travel!<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/61xNglavMXL.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_a5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Ashley T.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>I travel frequently for work and have tried so many travel pillows, but this one really stands out! The soft eye mask blocks light completely, while the stretchy sling keeps my arms comfortably supported. I love how compact it is and that I can use the pieces separately. It took a little practice to set up, but once I got comfortable, I almost fell asleep! Definitely a great travel companion.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/71lRVvQER7L.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_wch9ap": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Megan R.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": ""
          }
        },
        "review_cUryjU": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 4,
            "author": "Nicole B.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>I used this on an 8-hour flight and it was really comfortable! The head support worked well, the eye mask blocked out light, and the wrap kept my arms cozy. It took me a little time to adjust everything at first, but once I got it right, I slept much better. Overall, a great travel accessory!</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_ra6AQV": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Laura K.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>Must have for long haul flights! Worked great when I wanted to sleep. Folds up small and easily hooks to a carryon bag.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
